{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game won\u2019t tell you an epic story or amaze you with mind-blowing graphics. It\u2019s built to give you a series of carefully crafted battles. A free indie project where every mechanic works together as one whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aggressive dashing.</strong> Forget about passive play and rolling around to avoid damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique weapons.</strong> Each serves its own purpose \u2014 and you don\u2019t have to bother with weapon switching. Every weapon is always available, instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced and demanding.</strong> The challenge is tough but fair. Whenever there\u2019s ambiguity, the game bends the rules in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two power-ups instead of style points.</strong> Modify and upgrade your weapons through your own actions, tailoring them to the fight. Turn your pistol into a shotgun or speed up your bow\u2019s powerful charge shot \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything pushes you to aggression.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield ran out? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a dash? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to charge the bow faster? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelmed by enemy combos? Kill them before they do anything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I mention you\u2019ll need to kill enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick restarts.</strong> Yes, you will die. Yes, you only have one life. But I made sure the flow of battle never stops. Some playtesters literally burned out from the intensity.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Protostar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/b3b3da4af431ec9e73508f027c07d81197559b2c.jpg"},{"name":"Red giant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/1b928f10945960494890a0d9bbd32ba3fcda1745.jpg"},{"name":"Blue supergiant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/c3ed2789a0ae95499d1760213834bfe85d23e1eb.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow dwarf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/849e107c5470481e7c5a89daf6e5fdc611bbc974.jpg"},{"name":"Edge of the Observable Universe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/a4261a516f3740eb18c67c23f06805c65fc1dcb4.jpg"},{"name":"Hyperspace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/fc8c6f4b000f0c349295bb665e28e494939d2782.jpg"},{"name":"Done in 12 Parsecs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/aee22373a4522f35a0647be9dff8a4fb059301ef.jpg"},{"name":"Main sequence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/dc77950babfa75bf78bbf9e9e14ae0beeb3e9988.jpg"},{"name":"\u0421onstellation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/b549a9cdc61f4702ba43b6f2710f8682350511c2.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Star System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003010/00ceb5803516e6b789a58a17ff3dd6eb0ae8f45c.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003010?t=1766772869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003010?t=1766772869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003010/50bab8db7339183b5d7afcdfa7e6637272c78ade/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766772869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003010/50bab8db7339183b5d7afcdfa7e6637272c78ade/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766772869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game won\u2019t tell you an epic story or amaze you with mind-blowing graphics. It\u2019s built to give you a series of carefully crafted battles. A free indie project where every mechanic works together as one whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aggressive dashing.</strong> Forget about passive play and rolling around to avoid damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique weapons.</strong> Each serves its own purpose \u2014 and you don\u2019t have to bother with weapon switching. Every weapon is always available, instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced and demanding.</strong> The challenge is tough but fair. Whenever there\u2019s ambiguity, the game bends the rules in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two power-ups instead of style points.</strong> Modify and upgrade your weapons through your own actions, tailoring them to the fight. Turn your pistol into a shotgun or speed up your bow\u2019s powerful charge shot \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything pushes you to aggression.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield ran out? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a dash? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to charge the bow faster? Kill enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelmed by enemy combos? Kill them before they do anything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I mention you\u2019ll need to kill enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick restarts.</strong> Yes, you will die. Yes, you only have one life. But I made sure the flow of battle never stops. Some playtesters literally burned out from the intensity.</p>","developers":["GameInCubes"],"dlc":[4064150],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003010/a2e8715c4161428e3efd252dc75f0ce06f7688cc/header.jpg?t=1766772869","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTS 450<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur and newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon / Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003010/1411261041/f93f9fc652d433a60c913a91ba53afd6ae1a7982/1759188973/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759189254","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003010/1411261041/f93f9fc652d433a60c913a91ba53afd6ae1a7982/1759188973/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759189254","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003010/1411261041/f93f9fc652d433a60c913a91ba53afd6ae1a7982/1759188973/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759189254","id":257208924,"name":